{"id":"expresio_n","lemma":"expresión","pos":"noun","rank":2129,"glosses":["expression"],"ipa":"/eɡspɾeˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"expresiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-expresi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una expresión.","en":"It's an expression.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ambas expresiones son correctas.","en":"Both expressions are correct.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741273","words":[{"g":"both","l":"ambos"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"correct, right","l":"correcto"}]},{"text":"Me miró con una expresión extraña.","en":"He looked at me with a strange expression.","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to look at","l":"mirar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"China aster"}]},{"text":"Juzgando por la expresión de su cara, parece preocupada.","en":"Judging from the expression on her face, she is worried.","words":[{"g":"to judge","l":"juzgar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"face"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"worried, concerned","l":"preocupado"}]},{"text":"El profesor dijo que teníamos que aprender todas estas expresiones de memoria.","en":"The teacher said we had to learn all these expressions by heart.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"professor"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to learn"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[10,12,"by heart"]]}]}